anagrande）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ariana Grande暴瘦前的樣子。（instagram@arianagrande）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3715764/org/29f625fb35e049db501742fc9ecd5a8a.jpg/s01Z_Qx2zc___IIlOYZW3nk1XJJK7KiKNl7hKjZe4So\"/><figcaption>Ariana Grande暴瘦前的樣子。（instagram@arianagrande）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ariana Grande暴瘦前的樣子。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3579690/org/e0f8703894dc486b6e237841222469bf.jpg/0jXIViuUpoNlNUBUOpTwaShJ3SFFtG3PJidA4CYnQOA\"/><figcaption>Ariana Grande暴瘦前的樣子。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><p>71歲傳奇搖滾大咖「獵豹克羅姆」離世！樂團發聲：請給予家屬隱私</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T08:21:18.017139+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2347,"images":35,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}